OL,3,GNEWSACelebrations as steam returns to
OL,4,Apumping station
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers at a pumping-station
OL,7,Fheritage site are celebrating the
OL,8,Freturn to service of two steam engines,
OL,9,Fwhich were switched off four years ago
OL,10,Fover safety concerns.
OL,12,FA tall chimney at Coleham Pumping
OL,13,FStation in Shrewsbury was found to be
OL,14,Funsafe in 2022, and there were fears
OL,15,Fthat steam engines there would never be
OL,16,Ffired again.
OL,18,FThe building, built in about 1900,
OL,19,Fhouses two huge steam-driven beam
OL,20,Fengines which were once used to pump
OL,21,Fsewage in the town until the 1970s. The
OL,22,Fsite reopened as a museum.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
